<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA DRAW WITH LEEWARD ISLANDS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA DRAW WITH LEEWARD ISLANDS.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka and the Leeward Islands drew their three-day tour match on the final day on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 192-6 declared and 398-4 declared, Leeward Islands 148 and 128-0.</p>
